{"name":"Rosy Fluffy Bedspread","hex":"#cc77ff","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"rosy","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Rose-coloured.","Of any reddish hue from bright pink to the color of ruddy cheeks in a light-skinned person."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make pinkish in colour.","To present in a deceptively optimistic or positive light."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rosy"},{"term":"fluffy","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Covered with fluff.","Light; soft; airy."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Someone or something that has a fluffy texture.","A person who is superficial, who lacks depth or seriousness."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fluffy"},{"term":"bedspread","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The topmost covering of a bed, often functioning as a blanket.","A coverlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bedspread"}],"entries":[{"title":"Rosy","blocks":[{"text":"Rosy is a given name or nickname and, more rarely, a surname. It may refer to:"}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosy","wikidata":"Q56540504"},{"title":"Bedding","blocks":[{"text":"Bedding, also called bedclothes or bed linen, is the materials laid above the mattress of a bed for hygiene, warmth, protection of the mattress, and decorative effect, i.e. the removable and washable portion of a human sleeping environment. Multiple sets of bedding for each bed are often washed in rotation and/or changed seasonally to improve sleep comfort at varying room temperatures. Most standardized measurements for bedding are rectangular, but there are also some square-shaped sizes, which allow the user to put on bedding without having to consider its lengthwise orientation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Bettwaesche.jpg/330px-Bettwaesche.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org